    konusanCinsiyeti: 0
    konusanYasGrubu: 0
  - speakerName: Afor
    text: "D\xFCn canavarlar m\u0131 vard\u0131? Nas\u0131l g\xF6r\xFCn\xFCyorlard\u0131."
